{
  "id": "dmw7ydomsve9d",
  "name": "命令面板",
  "tags": [
    "搜索",
    "导航",
    "弹窗"
  ],
  "summary": "Ctrl/⌘+K 唤起居中面板，输入即模糊过滤页面与动作；↑↓ 切换选中、Enter 执行、Esc 关闭；分组标题 + 右侧快捷键徽标。",
  "usage": "桌面端全局搜索 / 快速跳转：高频页面与动作（8–20 个），已有搜索入口的页面用它加速操作。",
  "caution": "只收高频动作，别把整个菜单搬进去；移动端改用搜索页；Ctrl/⌘+K 要在输入框内屏蔽，防误触发。",
  "hint": "按 Ctrl/⌘+K 或点搜索框；输入过滤，↑↓ 选择，Enter 执行",
  "prompt": "【命令面板】目标：按 Ctrl/⌘+K 或点顶部「搜索或跳转…」按钮，屏幕中央弹出命令面板；输入即模糊过滤页面与动作，↑↓ 切换选中（循环），Enter 执行、Esc 关闭；结果按「页面 / 操作」分组，每项右侧显示快捷键徽标。演示自动展示「输入 → 过滤 → 选中移动 → 执行」。\n\n1) 结构：.app（原页面：顶栏 + 卡片列表）；.backdrop（position:fixed; inset:0）；.palette（position:fixed; left:50%; top:14%; width:min(520px, calc(100vw - 40px))，flex 纵向 = .psearch 搜索行 + .plist 结果区，overflow:auto）；结果项 .pit = .pic 图标 + .pnm 名称 + kbd 快捷键徽标；右上角 .toast 反馈条 = .toast i（**直线 SVG 对勾**，见第 6 条）+ 文案。\n\n2) 动画：面板 opacity 0→1、transform translate(-50%,-8px) scale(.98) → translate(-50%,0) scale(1)，0.2 秒 cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1.04)；遮罩 opacity 0→1，0.2 秒。执行后关闭反向，原页面右上角反馈条 1.6 秒后淡出。\n\n3) 交互：Ctrl/⌘+K 随时开关（打开时再按一次关闭）；输入实时过滤；↑↓ 循环切换选中并把选中项滚进 .plist 的可见区（自己算容器 scrollTop，**不要用 scrollIntoView**——iframe 里它会把所有祖先框架一起滚，外层页面会被拽走）；Enter 执行当前项；Esc 或点遮罩关闭；点击结果项直接执行。执行后关闭面板并弹反馈条。\n\n4) 无障碍：role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label；输入框 role=\"combobox\" + aria-controls + aria-expanded；结果区 role=\"listbox\"，每项 role=\"option\" + aria-selected 同步；打开时 input.focus({preventScroll:true})，关闭还给触发按钮（同样带 preventScroll）。\n\n5) 坑：快捷键要在 input / textarea / contenteditable 里屏蔽（别在输入框里误触发）；过滤后空组要把组标题一起隐藏；过滤会重置选中索引，要夹紧，否则 Enter 执行到不存在的项；不要给 backdrop 用 display:none（过渡会失效）；内容超过一屏只让 .plist 滚动，搜索行固定。\n\n6) 配色：只用 --ui-* 变量；选中项背景 color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent) + 左侧 2px brand 竖条；快捷键徽标 --ui-surface-2 + --ui-border；反馈条的对勾是**直线 SVG**（24 格 viewBox 折线 `<path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/>`，stroke:currentColor、stroke-width 2.4、round linecap/linejoin，尺寸 12px，颜色走 --ui-success），不要用字体字符当勾；品牌色上的文字用 --ui-bg，别写 #fff。\n\n7) 自动演示：包在 if(!window.__uiInteractive) 里循环：光标点搜索按钮 → 面板打开 → 逐字输入「项目」→ 选中下移到「新建项目」→ Enter 执行 → 关闭面板 + 显示「已执行 · 新建项目」→ 1.9 秒后重来；弹窗里只绑真实交互。\n\n8) 使用场景：桌面端全局搜索 / 快速跳转，页面与动作合计 8–20 个；只收高频动作，别把整个菜单搬进去；移动端改用搜索页。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg)}\n\n/* ---------- 底层页面 ---------- */\n.app{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:14px 16px}\n.topbar{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;min-width:0}\n.logo{width:18px;height:18px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 72%,#fff),var(--ui-brand))}\n.topbar b{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}\n.searchBtn{margin-left:auto;flex:0 1 250px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text-dim);font:inherit;font-size:11px;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:transform .12s ease,border-color .15s ease;min-width:0}\n.searchBtn:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 40%,var(--ui-border))}\n.searchBtn.pressing,.searchBtn:active{transform:scale(.98)}\n.searchBtn .mag{font-size:12px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.searchBtn .ph{flex:1;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left}\n.searchBtn .keys{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;gap:3px}\n.avatar{width:20px;height:20px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:50%;margin-left:2px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 30%,var(--ui-surface)),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 10%,var(--ui-surface)))}\n.cards{flex:1;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;overflow:hidden}\n.card{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 12px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border)}\n.card .ico{width:26px;height:26px;flex:0 0 auto;border-radius:8px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 13%,transparent)}\n.card .lines{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}\n.card .lines b{height:7px;width:52%;border-radius:4px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 12%,transparent)}\n.card .lines span{height:6px;width:78%;border-radius:4px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 7%,transparent)}\n\nkbd{font-family:inherit;font-size:10px;line-height:1;padding:3px 5px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n\n/* 执行反馈 */\n.toast{position:absolute;top:12px;right:14px;z-index:30;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);box-shadow:0 10px 30px color-mix(in srgb,#000 16%,transparent);font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text);opacity:0;transform:translateY(-6px);transition:opacity .2s ease,transform .24s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1.04);pointer-events:none}\n.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:none}\n.toast i{font-style:normal;color:var(--ui-success);font-weight:700;display:flex;align-items:center}\n.toast i svg{display:block;width:12px;height:12px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.4;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n\n/* ---------- 遮罩 + 命令面板 ---------- */\n.backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:10;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 46%,transparent);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(2px);backdrop-filter:blur(2px);opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .2s ease}\n.backdrop.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto}\n\n.palette{position:fixed;left:50%;top:14%;z-index:20;width:min(520px,calc(100vw - 40px));max-height:calc(100vh - 120px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 30px 80px color-mix(in srgb,#000 28%,transparent);overflow:hidden;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transform:translate(-50%,-8px) scale(.98);transition:opacity .18s ease,transform .22s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1.04)}\n.palette.show{opacity:1;pointer-events:auto;transform:translate(-50%,0) scale(1)}\n.psearch{flex:0 0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ui-border)}\n.psearch .mag{font-size:14px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.psearch input{flex:1;min-width:0;border:0;outline:none;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);font:inherit;font-size:13px;padding:0}\n.psearch input::placeholder{color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.psearch .esc{flex:0 0 auto}\n.plist{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;padding:6px}\n/* 滚动条：细窄、无箭头、淡色，悬停加深；只写 webkit 伪元素，Firefox 走 @supports 兜底（同时写 scrollbar-width/color 会让 ::-webkit-scrollbar 整体失效） */\n.plist::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px}\n.plist::-webkit-scrollbar-button{display:none;width:0;height:0}\n.plist::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:transparent;margin:6px 0}\n.plist::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 30%,transparent);border:3px solid transparent;border-right-width:4px;background-clip:padding-box;border-radius:999px}\n.plist::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 50%,transparent);background-clip:padding-box}\n.plist::-webkit-scrollbar-corner{background:transparent}\n@supports not selector(::-webkit-scrollbar){\n  .plist{scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:var(--ui-text-dim) transparent}\n}\n.pgrp{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;margin-bottom:4px}\n.pgl{font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);padding:6px 8px 4px;letter-spacing:.3px}\n.pit{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:8px 9px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;color:var(--ui-text);transition:background .12s ease}\n.pit:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2)}\n.pit.sel{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 12%,transparent)}\n.pit.sel::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:7px;bottom:7px;width:2px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--ui-brand)}\n.pit .pic{width:24px;height:24px;flex:0 0 auto;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:7px;background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-style:normal;font-size:11px}\n.pit.sel .pic{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 16%,transparent);color:var(--ui-text)}\n.pnm{flex:1;min-width:0;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.pit kbd{flex:0 0 auto}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .app{padding:9px 11px;gap:8px}\n  .topbar b{font-size:11px}\n  .logo{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px}\n  .avatar{width:16px;height:16px}\n  .searchBtn{flex:0 1 176px;font-size:10px;padding:4px 7px;gap:5px}\n  .cards{gap:6px}\n  .card{padding:7px 9px;border-radius:9px}\n  .card .ico{width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px}\n  .palette{top:6px;width:min(440px,calc(100vw - 20px));max-height:calc(100% - 12px);border-radius:10px}\n  .psearch{padding:7px 10px;gap:6px}\n  .psearch input{font-size:11px}\n  .plist{padding:4px}\n  .pgl{font-size:8px;padding:3px 6px 2px}\n  .pit{padding:4px 6px;gap:6px;font-size:10px;border-radius:6px}\n  .pit .pic{width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:5px;font-size:9px}\n  kbd{font-size:8px;padding:2px 4px}\n  .toast{top:8px;right:8px;font-size:10px;padding:5px 9px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .palette,.backdrop,.toast,.searchBtn,.pit{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <i class=\"logo\"></i><b>工作台</b>\n    <button class=\"searchBtn\" id=\"searchBtn\" type=\"button\">\n      <span class=\"mag\">⌕</span><span class=\"ph\">搜索页面或操作…</span>\n      <span class=\"keys\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>K</kbd></span>\n    </button>\n    <i class=\"avatar\"></i>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cards\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"ico\"></i><div class=\"lines\"><b></b><span></span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"ico\"></i><div class=\"lines\"><b></b><span></span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><i class=\"ico\"></i><div class=\"lines\"><b></b><span></span></div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"toast\" id=\"toast\"><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5.5 12.5l4.2 4.1 8.8-9.6\"/></svg></i><span id=\"toastTxt\">已执行</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"backdrop\" id=\"backdrop\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"palette\" id=\"palette\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"命令面板\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n  <div class=\"psearch\">\n    <span class=\"mag\">⌕</span>\n    <input id=\"input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"搜索页面或操作…\" role=\"combobox\" aria-controls=\"list\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"搜索页面或操作\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\">\n    <kbd class=\"esc\">Esc</kbd>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"plist\" id=\"list\" role=\"listbox\" aria-label=\"命令结果\">\n    <div class=\"pgrp\">\n      <div class=\"pgl\">页面</div>\n      <div class=\"pit\" role=\"option\" data-name=\"首页\" aria-selected=\"false\"><i class=\"pic\">⌂</i><span class=\"pnm\">首页</span><kbd>⌘1</kbd></div>\n      <div class=\"pit\" role=\"option\" data-name=\"项目\" aria-selected=\"false\"><i class=\"pic\">▤</i><span class=\"pnm\">项目</span><kbd>⌘2</kbd></div>\n      <div class=\"pit\" role=\"option\" data-name=\"文档\" aria-selected=\"false\"><i class=\"pic\">✎</i><span class=\"pnm\">文档</span><kbd>⌘3</kbd></div>\n      <div class=\"pit\" role=\"option\" data-name=\"设置\" aria-selected=\"false\"><i class=\"pic\">⚙</i><span class=\"pnm\">设置</span><kbd>⌘,</kbd></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pgrp\">\n      <div class=\"pgl\">操作</div>\n      <div class=\"pit\" role=\"option\" data-name=\"新建项目\" aria-selected=\"false\"><i class=\"pic\">＋</i><span class=\"pnm\">新建项目</span><kbd>⌘N</kbd></div>\n      <div class=\"pit\" role=\"option\" data-name=\"邀请成员\" aria-selected=\"false\"><i class=\"pic\">人</i><span class=\"pnm\">邀请成员</span><kbd>⌘I</kbd></div>\n      <div class=\"pit\" role=\"option\" data-name=\"导出数据\" aria-selected=\"false\"><i class=\"pic\">⇩</i><span class=\"pnm\">导出数据</span><kbd>⌘E</kbd></div>\n      <div class=\"pit\" role=\"option\" data-name=\"切换主题\" aria-selected=\"false\"><i class=\"pic\">◐</i><span class=\"pnm\">切换主题</span><kbd>⌘T</kbd></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var palette = document.getElementById('palette'),\n      backdrop = document.getElementById('backdrop'),\n      input = document.getElementById('input'),\n      list = document.getElementById('list'),\n      searchBtn = document.getElementById('searchBtn'),\n      toastEl = document.getElementById('toast'),\n      toastTxt = document.getElementById('toastTxt');\n\n  var isOpen = false, sel = 0, timers = [], cursor = null, cursorReady = false, toastTimer = null;\n\n  function later(fn, ms){ timers.push(setTimeout(fn, ms)); }\n  function clearTimers(){ for(var i = 0; i < timers.length; i++) clearTimeout(timers[i]); timers = []; }\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursorReady) return cursor;\n    cursorReady = true;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function') cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    return cursor;\n  }\n  function showCursor(){ if(cursor && cursor.el) cursor.el.classList.add('show'); }\n\n  // 只滚 iframe 内部的列表，绝不用 el.scrollIntoView()：\n  // iframe 里的 scrollIntoView 会按规范把「所有祖先框架」滚进来，包括外层的设计库页面，\n  // 用户滚到页面底部看卡片时会被莫名拉回顶部。\n  function scrollItemIntoList(el){\n    if(!el || !list) return;\n    var r = el.getBoundingClientRect(), lr = list.getBoundingClientRect();\n    if(r.top < lr.top) list.scrollTop -= (lr.top - r.top);\n    else if(r.bottom > lr.bottom) list.scrollTop += (r.bottom - lr.bottom);\n  }\n\n  function fuzzy(text, q){\n    text = String(text).toLowerCase();\n    q = String(q).toLowerCase();\n    var at = 0;\n    for(var i = 0; i < q.length; i++){\n      at = text.indexOf(q.charAt(i), at);\n      if(at < 0) return false;\n      at++;\n    }\n    return true;\n  }\n  function visItems(){\n    var all = list.querySelectorAll('.pit'), out = [];\n    for(var i = 0; i < all.length; i++) if(all[i].style.display !== 'none') out.push(all[i]);\n    return out;\n  }\n  function paint(scroll){\n    var v = visItems();\n    if(sel > v.length - 1) sel = v.length - 1;\n    if(sel < 0) sel = 0;\n    for(var i = 0; i < v.length; i++){\n      v[i].classList.toggle('sel', i === sel);\n      v[i].setAttribute('aria-selected', i === sel ? 'true' : 'false');\n    }\n    if(scroll && v[sel]) scrollItemIntoList(v[sel]);\n    return v;\n  }\n  function filter(q){\n    var all = list.querySelectorAll('.pit');\n    for(var i = 0; i < all.length; i++){\n      var ok = !q || fuzzy(all[i].getAttribute('data-name'), q);\n      all[i].style.display = ok ? '' : 'none';\n    }\n    var grps = list.querySelectorAll('.pgrp');\n    for(var j = 0; j < grps.length; j++){\n      var kids = grps[j].querySelectorAll('.pit'), vis = 0;\n      for(var k = 0; k < kids.length; k++) if(kids[k].style.display !== 'none') vis++;\n      grps[j].style.display = vis ? '' : 'none';\n    }\n    sel = 0;\n    paint();\n  }\n  function toast(name){\n    toastTxt.textContent = '已执行 · ' + name;\n    toastEl.classList.add('show');\n    if(toastTimer) clearTimeout(toastTimer);\n    toastTimer = setTimeout(function(){ toastEl.classList.remove('show'); toastTimer = null; }, 1600);\n  }\n\n  function openPalette(){\n    if(isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = true;\n    input.value = '';\n    filter('');\n    backdrop.classList.add('show');\n    palette.classList.add('show');\n    try { input.focus({ preventScroll: true }); } catch(e){ /* 老浏览器不支持 preventScroll：宁可不动焦点，也不裸 focus（会把外层页面滚过来） */ }\n  }\n  function closePalette(){\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    isOpen = false;\n    backdrop.classList.remove('show');\n    palette.classList.remove('show');\n    try { searchBtn.focus({ preventScroll: true }); } catch(e){ /* 同上：不裸 focus */ }\n  }\n  function run(){\n    var v = visItems();\n    if(!v.length) return;\n    var name = v[sel].getAttribute('data-name');\n    closePalette();\n    toast(name);\n  }\n\n  searchBtn.addEventListener('click', openPalette);\n  backdrop.addEventListener('click', closePalette);\n  input.addEventListener('input', function(){ filter(input.value); });\n  list.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    var t = e.target && e.target.closest ? e.target.closest('.pit') : null;\n    if(!t) return;\n    var v = visItems();\n    var idx = v.indexOf(t);\n    if(idx > -1) sel = idx;\n    run();\n  });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){\n    var mod = (e.metaKey || e.ctrlKey) && !e.altKey;\n    if(mod && (e.key === 'k' || e.key === 'K')){\n      e.preventDefault();\n      if(isOpen) closePalette(); else openPalette();\n      return;\n    }\n    if(!isOpen) return;\n    if(e.key === 'Escape'){ e.preventDefault(); closePalette(); }\n    else if(e.key === 'ArrowDown'){ e.preventDefault(); var vd = visItems(); if(vd.length) sel = (sel + 1) % vd.length; paint(true); }\n    else if(e.key === 'ArrowUp'){ e.preventDefault(); var vu = visItems(); if(vu.length) sel = (sel - 1 + vu.length) % vu.length; paint(true); }\n    else if(e.key === 'Enter'){ e.preventDefault(); run(); }\n  });\n\n  function typeText(text, i){\n    if(i >= text.length){ filter(text); sel = 0; paint(true); return; }\n    input.value = text.slice(0, i + 1);\n    filter(input.value);\n    later(function(){ typeText(text, i + 1); }, 110);\n  }\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimers();\n    closePalette();\n    toastEl.classList.remove('show');\n    if(toastTimer){ clearTimeout(toastTimer); toastTimer = null; }\n    input.value = '';\n    filter('');\n    if(window.__uiInteractive) return;\n    ensureCursor();\n    if(!cursor){\n      later(openPalette, 450);\n      later(function(){ input.value = '项目'; filter('项目'); }, 1200);\n      later(run, 2200);\n      later(function(){ demoCycle(); }, 3400);\n      return;\n    }\n    showCursor();\n    cursor.moveTo(searchBtn);\n    later(function(){\n      cursor.press();\n      searchBtn.classList.add('pressing');\n      later(function(){\n        cursor.release();\n        searchBtn.classList.remove('pressing');\n        openPalette();\n        later(function(){\n          var ir = input.getBoundingClientRect();\n          if(cursor.at) cursor.at(ir.right - 16, ir.top + ir.height / 2);\n          typeText('项目', 0);\n        }, 300);\n      }, 190);\n    }, 560);\n    later(function(){ sel = 1; paint(true); }, 1950);\n    later(function(){ run(); }, 2550);\n    later(function(){ if(typeof cursor.hide === 'function') cursor.hide(); }, 3300);\n    later(demoCycle, 5200);\n  }\n\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){ /* 弹窗里只绑真实交互 */ }\n  else { setTimeout(demoCycle, 300); }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>\n",
